00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,100
the last few episodes. Hello,
I'm Russell and welcome

4
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:13,650
to episode 13 of the
Articulate Journal where I'm

5
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:17,940
exploring what it takes to
build an AI-native architecture

6
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:22,770
