59
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:30,780
And some of the strongest
options aren't actually single

60
00:03:30,820 --> 00:03:36,080
technologies. For example, Microsoft
Agent Framework combined with Temporal

61
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:40,810
is extremely compelling. Microsoft
Agent Framework gives me the

62
