I've spent a large part
of my career working

67
00:03:59,780 --> 00:04:03,080
with C# and.NET. So this
would put Articulate in

68
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:07,670
a technology ecosystem.
I know extremely well.

69
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:12,130
That's not something I should
pretend doesn't influence the

70
00:04:12,170 --> 00:04:15,840
decision. I understand the
framework that has value.

71
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:19,970
It reduces implementation
risk. It makes it easier for

72
00:04:20,010 --> 00:04:23,120
