programming language in the

76
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:34,740
ecosystem at the same time.

77
00:04:35,180 --> 00:04:39,930
So Microsoft Agent Framework
and Temporal is a very

78
00:04:39,970 --> 00:04:50,370
