102
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:27,100
In some ways, it's one of
the strongest combinations

103
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:31,010
on the shortlist. But now,
Articulate has two significant

104
00:06:31,050 --> 00:06:36,110
