learning and reasoning, I think

145
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,840
Python is the strongest strategic fit.

146
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:29,350
So Dapr Agents being
Python isn't the reason for

147
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:34,780
choosing Python. The two decisions
simply reinforce each other.

148
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:37,930
And after all of that, I still come back

149
00:09:37,970 --> 00:09:41,880
to Dapr. Not because Dapr
Agents is obviously better

150
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:46,090
