Not because Dapr Workflows is

151
00:09:46,130 --> 00:09:50,500
more capable than Temporal.
And not because Dapr has

152
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:54,150
the strongest reasoning
abstraction. I don't think I could

153
00:09:54,190 --> 00:09:55,850
defend any of those claims.

154
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:58,080
What attracts me to Dapr is the shape of

155
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,800
the platform around the agents.

156
00:10:00,180 --> 00:10:03,780
Articulate needs agents
and durable workflows.

157
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:07,460
But it's also going to need
messaging, state, service

158
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:13,120
