161
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:25,800
Dapr gives me a common distributed
application runtime across

162
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:30,090
these concerns. And its sidecar
model gives the application

163
00:10:30,130 --> 00:10:34,850
