166
00:10:45,130 --> 00:10:51,960
GCP or whatever else. I'm
choosing an execution architecture

167
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:58,060
without unnecessarily choosing the
eventual infrastructure architecture at

168
00:10:58,100 --> 00:11:00,990
the same time. And that
gives me something I

169
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:04,720
value quite highly at this
stage of Articulate optionality.

170
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:07,800
But that flexibility isn't free.

171
00:11:08,150 --> 00:11:10,860
Choosing Dapr means
accepting a broader runtime.

172
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:13,880
There's another process running
