actually emerging in the architecture?

184
00:11:54,180 --> 00:11:56,820
And for Articulate, I think they do.

185
00:11:57,180 --> 00:12:02,720
PubSub, state, service invocation,
observability, durable workflows,

186
00:12:02,910 --> 00:12:07,870
distributed execution. These aren't
speculative requirements anymore.

187
00:12:08,180 --> 00:12:10,840
They are appearing in the architecture.

188
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:13,660
So, I'm accepting ADR 0001.

189
00:12:14,180 --> 00:12:18,380
Articulate will use Dapr
Agents as its initial agent

190
