192
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:30,860
I'm not saying Dapr is
the best agent runtime.

193
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:33,810
I don't think I've demonstrated that.

194
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:36,690
What I'm saying is Dapr
is currently the best

195
00:12:36,730 --> 00:12:40,860
