196
00:12:41,530 --> 00:12:44,780
Microsoft Agent Framework and
Temporal remains compelling.

197
00:12:45,530 --> 00:12:51,120
Microsoft Agent Framework with Durable
Task deserves further experimentation.

198
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:54,830
And LangGraph with Temporal is
particularly interesting if reasoning

199
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:59,120
