223
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:33,930
They're going to discover new information.

224
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:36,850
They're going to identify contradictions.

225
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:40,110
They're going to make new
claims about the architecture.

226
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:42,810
And some of those claims
may eventually need to

227
00:14:42,850 --> 00:14:45,720
