228
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:50,140
But an agent shouldn't
simply be able to rewrite

229
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:53,200
the Knowledge Model because
it has reached a new

230
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:57,940
conclusion. Architectural knowledge
needs to evolve without losing where

231
00:14:57,980 --> 00:15:01,830
it came from. What it replaced or what it

232
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:06,340
came to believe. So before
I start implementing agents,

233
00:15:06,380 --> 00:15:09,560
there's one more part of the
conceptual architecture I

234
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:14,860
need to understand. How does
architectural knowledge safely change

235
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:17,900
over time? That's the
question for the next episode.

236
00:15:18,540 --> 00:15:20,660
Knowledge Evolution.
